<div class="min-h-screen bg-[#f5f7f4] text-[#17251f]">
  <header class="border-b border-[#e4e9e4] bg-white">
    <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-[1440px] items-center justify-between px-5 py-4 sm:px-8">
      <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-3" aria-label="Dumpsite Watch home">
        <span class="grid size-10 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-[#173c32] text-[#c9ef78]">
          <.icon name="hero-globe-asia-australia" class="size-6" />
        </span>
        <span>
          <span class="block text-sm font-bold tracking-tight">Dumpsite Watch</span>
          <span class="block text-xs text-[#758179]">County operations</span>
        </span>
      </a>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="hidden rounded-full border border-[#e2e8e2] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-[#65736a] sm:inline-flex">
          Prototype · data setup
        </span>
        <button type="button" disabled class="inline-flex cursor-not-allowed items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-[#173c32] px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white opacity-50" title="Citizen reporting is planned">
          <.icon name="hero-plus" class="size-4" />
          <span class="hidden sm:inline">New report</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-5 py-8 sm:px-8 sm:py-10">
    <section class="mb-8 flex flex-col justify-between gap-5 lg:flex-row lg:items-end">
      <div>
        <p class="mb-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#648071]">Field intelligence</p>
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">Nairobi pilot overview</h1>
        <p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-6 text-[#68766e]">
          Boundary and published field observations are assembled. Study points remain unreviewed and do not mark dumpsite footprints.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 self-start rounded-xl border border-[#e1e7e1] bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm text-[#718077] lg:self-auto">
        <.icon name="hero-map-pin" class="size-4 text-[#789182]" />
        <span>Nairobi County · Pilot</span>
        <.icon name="hero-chevron-down" class="ml-2 size-4" />
      </div>
    </section>

    <section aria-label="Current monitoring summary" class="mb-6 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#e5eae5] bg-white p-5">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-sm text-[#718077]"><span>Sites under watch</span><.icon name="hero-eye" class="size-5" /></div>
        <p class="mt-5 text-3xl font-semibold">10</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-[#87928b]">Unreviewed study leads</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#e5eae5] bg-white p-5">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-sm text-[#718077]"><span>Reports to review</span><.icon name="hero-camera" class="size-5" /></div>
        <p class="mt-5 text-3xl font-semibold">2021</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-[#87928b]">Published field observations</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#e5eae5] bg-white p-5">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-sm text-[#718077]"><span>Area monitored</span><.icon name="hero-square-3-stack-3d" class="size-5" /></div>
        <p class="mt-5 text-3xl font-semibold">Loaded</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-[#87928b]">2020 geoBoundaries · EPSG:4326</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#e5eae5] bg-white p-5">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-sm text-[#718077]"><span>Data status</span><span class="size-2 rounded-full bg-[#d99b47]"></span></div>
        <p class="mt-5 text-xl font-semibold">Catalog pending</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-[#87928b]">Planetary Computer DNS unavailable</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="grid gap-6 xl:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.65fr)_minmax(340px,0.85fr)]">
      <article class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-[#e5eae5] bg-white">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-[#edf0ed] px-5 py-4 sm:px-6">
          <div><h2 class="font-semibold">Study area &amp; reference points</h2><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-[#87928b]">County outline with published river-study sampling coordinates</p></div>
          <span class="rounded-full bg-[#fff4e8] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-[#976431]">Unreviewed leads</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid min-h-[360px] place-items-center overflow-hidden bg-[#eef2ed] p-3 sm:min-h-[470px] sm:p-6">
          <img src={~p"/images/pilot-leads.svg"} alt="Map of Nairobi County with ten unreviewed river-study sampling points where the paper reported nearby dumping. The points are sampling locations, not dump footprints." class="max-h-[460px] w-full object-contain" />
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="rounded-2xl border border-[#e5eae5] bg-white">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#edf0ed] px-5 py-4 sm:px-6">
          <div><h2 class="font-semibold">Study sampling points</h2><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-[#87928b]">Ngong River field study · 2021</p></div>
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#976431]">10 unreviewed</span>
        </div>
        <div class="divide-y divide-[#edf0ed] px-5 sm:px-6">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 py-3"><div><p class="text-sm font-medium">Kibera Lindi Mosque</p><p class="text-xs text-[#87928b]">36.789409° E · 1.314737° S</p></div><span class="shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#fff4e8] px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-semibold text-[#976431]">Review</span></div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 py-3"><div><p class="text-sm font-medium">Outering Road Bridge</p><p class="text-xs text-[#87928b]">36.891182° E · 1.306702° S</p></div><span class="shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#fff4e8] px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-semibold text-[#976431]">Review</span></div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 py-3"><div><p class="text-sm font-medium">Enterprise Road Bridge</p><p class="text-xs text-[#87928b]">36.861962° E · 1.315906° S</p></div><span class="shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#fff4e8] px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-semibold text-[#976431]">Review</span></div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 py-3"><div><p class="text-sm font-medium">Likoni Road Bridge</p><p class="text-xs text-[#87928b]">36.854686° E · 1.315993° S</p></div><span class="shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#fff4e8] px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-semibold text-[#976431]">Review</span></div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 py-3"><div><p class="text-sm font-medium">Mukuru Kayaba</p><p class="text-xs text-[#87928b]">36.849808° E · 1.313388° S</p></div><span class="shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#fff4e8] px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-semibold text-[#976431]">Review</span></div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 py-3"><div><p class="text-sm font-medium">Soweto Embakasi Bridge</p><p class="text-xs text-[#87928b]">36.909088° E · 1.292102° S</p></div><span class="shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#fff4e8] px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-semibold text-[#976431]">Review</span></div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 py-3"><div><p class="text-sm font-medium">Kayole</p><p class="text-xs text-[#87928b]">36.918681° E · 1.281739° S</p></div><span class="shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#fff4e8] px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-semibold text-[#976431]">Review</span></div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 py-3"><div><p class="text-sm font-medium">Matopeni Twiga</p><p class="text-xs text-[#87928b]">36.934911° E · 1.265998° S</p></div><span class="shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#fff4e8] px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-semibold text-[#976431]">Review</span></div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 py-3"><div><p class="text-sm font-medium">Njiru Kangundo Road Bridge</p><p class="text-xs text-[#87928b]">36.945836° E · 1.248449° S</p></div><span class="shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#fff4e8] px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-semibold text-[#976431]">Review</span></div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 py-3"><div><p class="text-sm font-medium">Mong'etho before confluence</p><p class="text-xs text-[#87928b]">36.954100° E · 1.244761° S</p></div><span class="shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#fff4e8] px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-semibold text-[#976431]">Review</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-[#edf0ed] px-5 py-4 sm:px-6">
          <p class="text-xs leading-5 text-[#718077]">Each coordinate marks a river water-sampling location. The paper reports nearby dumping activity, but does not map waste-site boundaries or establish current conditions.</p>
          <a href="https://www.mdpi.com/2073-4441/15/4/660" class="mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-[#315d49] hover:text-[#173c32]">Open study source <.icon name="hero-arrow-up-right" class="size-3.5" /></a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-[#dfe8de] bg-[#edf3eb] p-5 sm:p-6">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <span class="hidden size-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-white text-[#53725d] sm:grid"><.icon name="hero-sparkles" class="size-5" /></span>
          <div><h2 class="text-sm font-semibold">Next: connect satellite observations</h2><p class="mt-1 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-6 text-[#6f7e72]">The Nairobi boundary is ready. Sentinel-2 catalog discovery still needs network access; after that, candidate polygons can be compared with these dated study leads and reviewed against imagery.</p></div>
        </div>
        <span class="shrink-0 rounded-lg border border-[#d5dfd4] bg-white/70 px-3 py-2 text-xs font-medium text-[#647269]">Nairobi boundary ready</span>
      </div>
    </section>
    <footer class="py-8 text-center text-xs text-[#98a29b]">Dumpsite Watch · Early warning for cleaner communities</footer>
  </main>
</div>
